          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. There are two boats, A and B. Boat A has a base area of 7 m"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2",
              "styles": [
                "superscript"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", and 5 persons are seated in it. Boat B has a base area of 3.5 m"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2",
              "styles": [
                "superscript"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", and 3 persons are seating in it. If each person has a weight of 700 N, find out which boat will experience more pressure on its base and by how much?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
