          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.216,
            0.883,
            0.292
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. What will happen to the two identical balloons A and B as shown in Fig. 6.24 when water is filled into the bottle up to a certain height. Will both the balloons bulge? If yes, will they bulge equally? Explain your answer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
